ue protege el conector USB y sus datos cuando no est\u00e1 en uso.<\/p><h2>Rendimiento fiable<\/h2><p>La ligera soluci\u00f3n de almacenamiento compatible con USB 3.2 Gen permite r\u00e1pidas transferencias de datos.<\/p><h2>La m\u00e1s avanzada portabilidad<\/h2><p>La presilla se engancha perfectamente en el llavero para el perfecto almacenamiento sobre la marcha.<\/p><p><br><\/p><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><ul><li>Capacidades 256 GB<\/li><li>Velocidad Compatible con USB 3.2 Gen 1<\/li><li>Dimensiones 60,7 mm x 21 mm x 10,2 mm<\/li><li>Peso 8 g<\/li><li>Temperatura de servicio 0\u00b0C~60\u00b0C<\/li><li>Temperatura de almacenamiento -20\u00b0C~85\u00b0C<\/li><li>Compatible con Windows\u00ae 11, 10, macOS\u00ae (v.10.15.x +), Linux (v. 4.4 +), Chrome OS&#8482;<\/li><\/ul><br><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"KINGSTON","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.02,"unit_price":16.4,"unit_price_tax":16.4,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Pendrives","sub_category":"Pendrives","quantity":5,"brand":"KINGSTON","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_kin-jetflash%20dtxon%20256gb_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":11.4}}},"8436531550479":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8436531550479",false],"wholesale_price":[4.5,false],"price":[9.5,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.16",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:160573","Cat. IDs: 2","Associated Categories","Cat. Default